// document (same company), rewritten for voice AI infrastructure: Voqalize as controller for the
// website, Tanvi, the demos, accounts and billing; as processor (under the DPA) for the voice
// data of our customers' end users. Placeholders use <Ph>. Source text and the list of changes:
